Example drawings and code samples
---------------------------------
The example drawings under examples/ (the .musa files, the programs that write them and their
render settings) and the code samples shown on the pages are, in addition, dedicated to the
public domain under CC0 1.0 (https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/), so you can
use them in your own work without credit.

